  "releaseNotes": "Light.PortableResults.AspNetCore.MinimalApis 0.3.0\n      ---------------------------------\n\n      - LightResult and LightResult<T> and corresponding extension methods to turn result instances into HTTP success responses or RFC 9457 (and RFC 7807) compatible Problem Details responses.\n      - Easy integration into ASP.NET Core's composition root via IServiceCollection.AddPortableResultsForMinimalApis.\n      - Compatible with .NET Native AOT.",
